  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Rules and targets",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Rules in force (they switch with the simulated date)\n| | **Winter rest** (Dec - Feb) | **Growing season** (Mar - Nov) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Safety minimum | 10 C | 15 C |\n| Day / night | day 18-24 C, night 10-14 C | day 21-28 C, night 15-18 C |\n| Watering | below 15 % moisture, at least 7 days apart, aim 40 % | below 30 %, at least 2 days apart, aim 60 % |\n| Feeding | none | manual, weak, weekly |\n| Grow light | tops the day up to 14 h and 15 mol/m2/day | off |\n| Shade | off | closes in strong light |\n\nDay = sunrise to sunset. Humidity 50-80 % by day. Daily light 12-20 mol/m2/day. Light at most 37.7 klux. Dashed lines on the charts show the limits of the current season."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Season (simulated calendar)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "greengrow-pg"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "rawSql": "SELECT CASE WHEN extract(month from sim_ts) IN (12,1,2) THEN 'Winter rest' ELSE 'Growing season' END AS season FROM greenhouse_reading ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 1"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/^season$/",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
